# Fistful of Fury (jeuno 41): the finishes read no status. A WAR 75, Norg fame 125, Silence of the Rams completed (a
# GM). 216 open, the quest set completed by a GM: option 1: addQuest over a completed quest (the current bit set, the
# status still completed). Then available and accepted (a GM): the three: 213 open, the quest set available by a GM:
# the finish completes it anyway (Brown Belt, title, fame, the trade taken); Quest[3][41]Prog 1 (GM) kept (the raw
# player:completeQuest).
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=45.8,3.9,-45.4 job=WAR lvl=75
fame Norg 125
quest Bastok.SilenceOfTheRams completed
item NueFang
item MorbolgerVine
item DodoSkin
login
trigger Vola                            # 216
quest Jeuno.FistfulOfFury completed     # a GM, while 216 is open
finish option=1                         # addQuest over a completed quest
quest Jeuno.FistfulOfFury available     # a GM (the completed bit cleared)
quest Jeuno.FistfulOfFury accepted      # a GM
charvar Quest[3][41]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var (the raw completeQuest keeps it)
trade Vola NueFang x1 MorbolgerVine x1 DodoSkin x1  # 213
quest Jeuno.FistfulOfFury available     # a GM, while 213 is open
finish                                  # no status read: Brown Belt; title; fame; the trade taken; completed
